<!-- My Writing Journal (running artifact) — the REVISED Writing Journal 3a -->

<!-- The revised twin of wj2_artifact (wj2/artifact.olx), mounted as the My Journal tab
     of the review build. It is a separate file rather than a second block in
     artifact.olx because an OLX file has exactly one root node, and the original file's
     root is wj2_artifact — adding a sibling there would mean restructuring shipping
     content for the sake of the review.

     Same five sections as the original, over the revised fields, plus the
     year-from-now answers, which the original has no equivalent of. Collapsibles are
     browsable but never printable (they render their children only when expanded), so
     exporting is wj3_print's job, not this tab's. -->

<Vertical id="wj3_artifact">

  <Markdown id="wj3_artifact_intro">
## My Writing Journal — Entry 2

This tab gathers your work in one place as you go, so you can see the whole journal at a glance — your
quiz results, whether the placement fit, where you'd like to be a year from now, the story you told, and
what the Circle heard in it. Come back any time to review what you have built.

*Submitting is handled on the **Print &amp; Submit** tab — that's where you'll confirm you're done and
export your PDF.*
  </Markdown>

  <Collapsible id="wj3_artifact_take" title="Where I started: is writer's block real?">
    <Markdown>**My first take, before the quiz:**</Markdown>
    <!-- <Use>, not <Ref>: a Ref renders the stored value, which is a code like `freeze`;
         <Use> re-renders the choices, showing the sentence the student picked. The one
         code with no sentence behind it is `other`, so its note follows. -->
    <Use ref="wj3_block_take" />
    <Markdown when="@wj3_block_take.value === 'other'">**What I said instead:** {{@wj3_take_other_text.value}}</Markdown>
  </Collapsible>

  <Collapsible id="wj3_artifact_results" title="1. My writing personality — three dimensions">
    <Markdown>**Where the quiz placed me:**</Markdown>
    <Ref id="wj3_art_results" target="wj3_results_feedback" />
  </Collapsible>

  <Collapsible id="wj3_artifact_fit" title="2. Does it fit?">
    <Markdown>**My answer:** {{@wj3_fit.value}}</Markdown>
    <Ref id="wj3_art_fit_text" target="wj3_fit_text" />
  </Collapsible>

  <Collapsible id="wj3_artifact_future" title="3. A year from now">
    <Markdown>**Purpose** — expression or evaluation:</Markdown>
    <Ref id="wj3_art_future_p" target="wj3_future_purpose" />
    <Markdown>**Orientation** — growth or performance:</Markdown>
    <Ref id="wj3_art_future_o" target="wj3_future_orientation" />
    <Markdown>**Experience** — engagement or avoidance:</Markdown>
    <Ref id="wj3_art_future_e" target="wj3_future_experience" />
  </Collapsible>

  <Collapsible id="wj3_artifact_story" title="4. My story — an experience that shaped me as a writer">
    <Ref id="wj3_art_story" target="wj3_story_text" />
  </Collapsible>

  <Collapsible id="wj3_artifact_response" title="5. What Alma heard in my story">
    <Ref id="wj3_art_response" target="wj3_response_feedback" />
  </Collapsible>

</Vertical>
